      "link": null,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JsoztgttoPto6xQrGUPkr",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1172.3651567394627,
      "y": -1569.9644242333711,
      "width": 754.7595825195312,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0gV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 82184922,
      "version": 308,
      "versionNonce": 1324800089,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1760554139615,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The main game loop involves leveling up by going deeper and deeper into the\ndungeon to defeat the monsters. When you die, that game does not end. You\ncontinue but loose all your loot from that run (maybe gear too?).",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "lliWLro8hVZl7NFMmdLJu",
      "originalText": "The main game loop involves leveling up by going deeper and deeper into the dungeon to defeat the monsters. When you die, that game does not end. You continue but loose all your loot from that run (maybe gear too?).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
